   "text": "Working demo:  about 84%\nReal product:  about 60%\n\nDone: logo & splash, sign-in, profile setup,\nvoice, order understanding, health checks,\nconfirmation, order history, order again\nBuilt, needs keys: online payment, SMS & email\nDemo only: store search, placing real orders\nNot built: delivery tracking, hosting online",
   "originalText": "Working demo:  about 84%\nReal product:  about 60%\n\nDone: logo & splash, sign-in, profile setup,\nvoice, order understanding, health checks,\nconfirmation, order history, order again\nBuilt, needs keys: online payment, SMS & email\nDemo only: store search, placing real orders\nNot built: delivery tracking, hosting online",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
