   "text": "Clerk: sign-in and accounts\nSupabase: database for profiles and orders\nRazorpay: online payment (UPI / card)\nResend: order emails\nTwilio: order SMS\nBrowser + offline speech: voice to text\nRedis: live 'agents at work' view",
