   "text": "1. Add Supabase database password\n2. Clerk: make phone optional at sign-up,\n    rename app to \"Mitra AI\"\n3. Add Razorpay test keys\n4. Add Resend (email) and Twilio (SMS) keys\n5. Start Redis for the live agent view\n6. Save work to GitHub (54 files waiting)",
   "originalText": "1. Add Supabase database password\n2. Clerk: make phone optional at sign-up,\n    rename app to \"Mitra AI\"\n3. Add Razorpay test keys\n4. Add Resend (email) and Twilio (SMS) keys\n5. Start Redis for the live agent view\n6. Save work to GitHub (54 files waiting)",
